Error [E0390]: `N` is a compile-time number parameter, which this compiler does not support yet.
  --> tests/ui/prep_number_param_unsupported.jet:4:20
    |
  4 | struct Packet<prep N: Int> {
    |                    ^
 Why: `<prep N: Int>` is the ratified declaration grammar, but number-parameter substitution, instance identity and layout (D-CONSTGEN1) are not implemented.
 Fix: Use a type parameter, or pass the number as an ordinary argument or field until number parameters ship.
